    "steps": [
      "Introduce an opaque ProfileInstanceId for one actual Arc<Session>, distinct from optional durable ProfileId and storage scope. Keep construction private and expose only comparison/hash/display value semantics.",
      "Expose BrowserApplication::profile_instance_id() -> Option<ProfileInstanceId>, None before activation and a real live identity for Normal, Private and Ephemeral profiles. Preserve all storage, permission/download and privacy behavior.",
      "Prove stable clones/shared live durable sessions, distinct independent memory/different-root sessions, renewal after all actual owners drop, and no lifetime extension by copied IDs.",
      "Run focused nonzero profile_instance_identity unit tests and full application --lib regressions on exact integrated source, then obtain independent source/evidence review. No Qt/native/physical claim."
    ],
